Help message (bark bark) To subscribe to a daily image of a dog (7AM UK time each morning, unguaranteed), reply 'subscribe'. This is totally for fun and not in any way guaranteed. The images are from an external source (The Dog CEO API - yeah I didn't know it existed either) and are unvetted and uncontrolled. This may stop working at any time. If I go haywire please tell my master, Matt (mabarber@). If you need to unsubscribe, write 'unsubscribe' anywhere in a message. Try some other commands - I maybe trained, after all, I am a very good boy!! Bark Bark Bark
